Z||000000||Elenor84||03-08-2001||07:10 PM||||Hey guys I posted a thing awhile ago on how to break into a fiero if u locked your key's in but for some really weird reason I couldn't find the thread...it would just be an error...so I'm just curious how to break into my car and maybe hot wire it...<BR>thx guys...<P>------------------<BR>Lance<BR>Click Image to go to site.<BR><A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/_XMCM/lancegspage/Index.html" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Side1.jpg"> </A>||||reg||1
