Z||000015||william_thorniii||03-09-2001||06:18 PM||||I am fully versed in indestructively breaking in to cars.  I will not explain why.  I can get into any fiero (that I have tried) in less than 5 seconds WITHOUT ANY tools.  For those of you that are coming up with this complex solutions, use your imagination and examine your body parts.  <P>Since some feel that our security has been compromised by this topic, I will not disclose the method here... however, it certainly does not take a rocket scientist to figure it out.  My dog could probably figure it out... don't feel bad though, he was a smart dog.  If you need some help, e-mail me and inform me of your specific situation.  I will use my discretion to determine if I will disclose this information to you or not.  <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||12
