Z||000027||Oreif||03-13-2001||10:24 PM||||The easiest way to get into your car is a spare key. It fast,easy, relable, does no damage and GM has it set up so 1 key opens and the other key starts it. So you just need the door key to open the door and keep a spare ignition key inside the car hidden.<P>(P.S. I got in before the big delete too!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> )<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 03-13-2001).]||||reg||12
Z||000028||Standard||03-13-2001||11:15 PM||||After I locked my key's in my 84 at school one day I started carrying around a spare.  It's saved me many,many,many times.  Almost did it again with my GT before I had a spare made, but thank jebus I hadn't closed the door all the way and my arm is long enough...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
